      "content": "SP 8607, SP 8707           WENDOVER              AYLESBURY ROAD                                                  east side 10/194 11/194                                           No.20 Barclays Bank                                                  (formerly Modbury) 11.12.75 GV                                               II Bank, formerly a house. Early C19, red brick old tile roof with chimney on RH against that of No.18 (q.v.). 2-storeys. 3 bays of sash windows in reveals with flat arches, central 6 panel door with arched fanlight having diagonal glazing pattern, doorcase of grooved pilasters and flat hood on moulded brackets. Listing NGR: SP8695607969"
